.model D D
.lib standard.dio
.model NMOS NMOS
.model PMOS PMOS
.lib standard.mos
* 1  INPUT: lab supply -> LM74700-Q1 ideal diode (Q3) -> input capacitors
* U5 LM74700-Q1 (behavioural): 20 mV forward regulation, -11 mV fast reverse turn-off, 11 mA gate pump
* CINcer = 10 x 2.2u X7R (DC-bias derated to 10u), CINbulk = 3 x 100u
* Lcable / Lloop / Rtrace / LgH / LgL: PCB and wiring parasitics (model only)
* 2  POWER STAGE: Q1/Q2 synchronous buck, L1 33u, RS1 4m shunt, COUT 2 x 330u
* Rload: 2.4 Ohm (60 W) or 1.6 Ohm (90 W); TEST=1 steps it to RFAULT (0.5 Ohm) at 7-10 ms
* @LOOP: LTspice FRA injection point (OUT -> FBOUT) for loop-gain measurement
* 3  CONTROLLER LTC3895 (peak current mode, forced continuous, fsw 94.3 kHz)
* Vprg and CLKout open. NDRV tied to DRVCC (internal LDO). EXTVcc = OUT.
* VOUT = 0.8*(1+140k/10k) = 12 V
* compensation A (fitted). B = 3.9k / 68n / 1n
* RUN on at 16.8 V, OVLO 58.1 V
* 4  AVERAGE CURRENT LIMIT 7.88 A: LT6105 (gain 20) + LT6654 1.25 V + LT1636 integrator -> clamps ITH
* I_lim = 1.25*12/23.8/(20*4m) = 7.88 A. U3 output sits at the rail until the limit is reached.
.param VIN=24 RL=2.4 TEST=0 RFAULT=0.5
.param IPUMP=11m VCLAMP=13
.func ireg() limit(0.2*(V(UNPROTECTED,CABLE)-0.02), -{IPUMP}, {IPUMP})
.func en_fw() 0.25*(1+tanh((V(UNPROTECTED)-3.9)/0.2))*(1+tanh((V(UNPROTECTED,CABLE)+0.011)/0.002))
.model BSC026N08NS5 VDMOS(Rg=1.9 Vto=3.0 Rd=20u Rs=412u Rb=1.37m Kp=70 Lambda=0.03 Cgdmin=29p Cgdmax=1.18n A=0.2 Cgs=4.9n Cjo=1.39n M=0.75 Is=49.5p VJ=2.5 N=1.12 TT=15n ksubthres=.1 mfg=Infineon Vds=80 Ron=2.6m Qg=74n)
.model BSC040N08NS5 VDMOS(Rg=1.1 Vto=3.0 Rd=31u Rs=634u Rb=2.11m Kp=40.6 Lambda=0.03 Cgdmin=17p Cgdmax=0.685n A=0.2 Cgs=2.84n Cjo=0.81n M=0.75 Is=28.7p VJ=2.5 N=1.12 TT=15n ksubthres=.1 mfg=Infineon_scaled_from_BSC026 Vds=80 Ron=4.0m Qg=43n)
.model BAT46WJ D(Is=.1703u N=1.06 Rs=1.3 Cjo=35p Vj=.4 M=.5 Eg=.69 XTI=2 Iave=.25 Vpk=100 mfg=NXP type=Schottky)
.lib LT6654-1.25.sub
.options plotwinsize=0 threads=1
.tran 0 14m 0 100n
.save V(OUT) V(SW) V(IN) V(SOURCE) V(ITH) V(CS) V(CCOUT) V(GH) V(GL) I(L1) I(V1) I(Rload) Id(MQ1) Id(MQ2)
* Run: 14 ms transient at VIN / RL above (steady state after ~8 ms). Official Infineon models: replace the two VDMOS .model lines.
